{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12351","headline":"送杨錥归隐 · 钱起","name":"送杨錥归隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悔作扫门事，还吟招隐诗。\n今年芳草色，不失故山期。\n遥想白云里，采苓春日迟。\n溪花藏石径，岩翠带茅茨。\n九转莫飞去，三回良在兹。\n还嗤茂陵客，贫病老明时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}